house is within walking distance, with additional access to the pool and fitness center at nearby Tuscana Resort. Located in the heart of ChampionsGate, the home is close to shopping, restaurants, entertainment, and major roadways, with Walt Disney World less than 15 minutes away and convenient access to the greater Orlando area. Enjoy the combination of a fully furnished home, gated community, peaceful pond views, resort-style amenities, and a prime ChampionsGate location. Schedule your private showing today and come see everything this home has to offer! REQUIREMENTS: Credit above 600, Income verified at least 2.25x the rent, no previous evictions Background. Credit And eviction check required. No Pets allowed, No exceptions to requirements. $100 application fee includes credit/background/eviction check. Fee is refunded in full if a tenant is placed before processing your application. Property can only rent 6 months at a time.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":2150,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0ce7f6aae11f80e689e5a1591101abbal-m882100789r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["garage","house_view","yard","front","incomplete","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/0ce7f6aae11f80e689e5a1591101abbal-m882100789s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/0ce7f6aae11f80e689e5a1591101abbal-m882100789r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0ce7f6aae11f80e689e5a1591101abbal-m471224793r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["door","porch","exterior"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/0ce7f6aae11f80e689e5a1591101abbal-m471224793s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/0ce7f6aae11f80e689e5a1591101abbal-m471224793r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0ce7f6aae11f80e689e5a1591101abbal-m2935278807r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["living_room"],"